<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer price index rose 0.1 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer price index rose 0.1 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's consumer price index rose by 0.1 percent in June from May for a year-on-year rise of 0.8 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES    June 97    May  97    June 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +0.1	  0.0	 -0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +0.8	 +0.3	 +0.8</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to fall by 0.1 percent in June for a year-on-year rise of 0.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
